 ☁️ AZ-900 Mini Projects

This Folder contains a series of mini projects I completed while learning the fundamentals of Microsoft Azure as part of my AZ-900 preparation.

Each project includes:
- A PDF report with step-by-step instructions and screenshots showing how the tasks were performed in the Azure portal.
- A README file that outlines my understanding of key Azure concepts such as virtual machines, resource groups, regions, and cloud service models — with technical explanations tied to the specific project.




